WEBVTT

00:01:08.860 --> 00:01:10.980
SWORD GAI

00:01:27.960 --> 00:01:31.170
His memories still remain...

00:01:31.920 --> 00:01:32.750
His feelings...

00:01:34.550 --> 00:01:37.590
What does he seek,
and why does he suffer?

00:01:45.730 --> 00:01:47.980
Gai, could you possibly have...

00:01:49.150 --> 00:01:51.650
returned to your former self?

00:01:52.610 --> 00:01:54.530
I came to you for a request.

00:01:58.320 --> 00:02:01.370
Please, I want you to destroy me
with your hands.

00:02:01.740 --> 00:02:05.040
No! You're not a weapon,
You're human!

00:02:05.950 --> 00:02:10.380
If one is ruled by rage,
and thinks only of the desire to kill,

00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:12.670
he is no longer human.

00:02:17.220 --> 00:02:18.430
Don't be stupid.

00:02:18.930 --> 00:02:20.840
You came back!

00:02:22.050 --> 00:02:23.310
That wound...

00:02:24.600 --> 00:02:27.020
The pain brought me back.

00:02:28.020 --> 00:02:29.770
But I can tell.

00:02:30.350 --> 00:02:32.770
I'll become a Busoma
when the wound heals.

00:02:35.650 --> 00:02:37.740
Do you remember the promise we made?

00:02:38.320 --> 00:02:39.660
I will never forget.

00:02:40.360 --> 00:02:44.120
When you become a Busoma,
I will destroy you myself.

00:02:44.620 --> 00:02:48.620
If I become a Busoma,
I might kill Sayaka this time.

00:02:50.040 --> 00:02:52.290
I might not be able
to come back next time.

00:02:53.590 --> 00:02:55.590
When that happens,
I will keep my promise.

00:02:56.840 --> 00:02:58.470
But not yet.

00:03:09.140 --> 00:03:09.980
Gai.

00:03:11.600 --> 00:03:12.440
Gai!

00:03:13.270 --> 00:03:14.110
Sayaka.

00:03:14.980 --> 00:03:15.980
She's awake?

00:03:17.480 --> 00:03:21.150
Gai, don't forget you have a sheathe
in which you belong.

00:03:31.830 --> 00:03:33.380
You came back, didn't you?

00:03:34.920 --> 00:03:38.170
You're still you, right?
The old Gai, right?

00:03:39.840 --> 00:03:40.720
Yeah.

00:03:50.770 --> 00:03:52.350
I'm so glad you came back.

00:03:52.690 --> 00:03:53.900
But where's Matoba?

00:03:54.230 --> 00:03:55.310
He's gone.

00:03:55.690 --> 00:03:56.520
Gone?

00:03:56.610 --> 00:03:59.570
He's not the Matoba you know anymore.
He's a Busoma.

00:03:59.650 --> 00:04:00.650
A Busoma...

00:04:01.320 --> 00:04:02.150
Yes.

00:04:02.900 --> 00:04:06.740
Oh, since you became human again,
maybe Matoba can also--

00:04:06.830 --> 00:04:07.950
That's impossible.

00:04:08.910 --> 00:04:11.580
Once you become a Busoma,
the darkness swallows you up.

00:04:12.500 --> 00:04:13.460
Forever.

00:04:14.120 --> 00:04:18.460
I think I was able to turn back
because of you.

00:04:18.840 --> 00:04:20.960
Blood... It's my fault!

00:04:21.420 --> 00:04:22.300
I'm sorry!

00:04:22.720 --> 00:04:23.970
This is how it should be.

00:04:24.930 --> 00:04:26.140
It's ironic.

00:04:26.680 --> 00:04:30.720
The blade I gave to protect you
ended up saving me.

00:04:31.480 --> 00:04:34.600
No, when I think about it,
it's always been like that.

00:04:34.690 --> 00:04:39.270
It was master who took me in,
and the only reason I survived this long

00:04:39.360 --> 00:04:40.440
was because of you.

00:04:41.490 --> 00:04:43.740
You've always been there for me.

00:04:44.200 --> 00:04:45.700
That's not true.

00:04:45.990 --> 00:04:48.620
You're strong, Gai. Strong and kind.

00:04:49.160 --> 00:04:50.700
I know that.

00:04:51.450 --> 00:04:52.830
No, I...

00:04:53.960 --> 00:04:54.870
It's true.

00:04:56.330 --> 00:05:00.500
You put your strength and kindness
into this blade.

00:05:00.590 --> 00:05:03.300
That power is what saved you.

00:05:04.170 --> 00:05:06.760
You saved yourself.

00:05:11.720 --> 00:05:13.310
Please don't leave me again.

00:05:14.680 --> 00:05:19.020
I want to be someone
you can come back to.

00:05:20.610 --> 00:05:22.440
When the sun rises, I'll come get you.

00:05:23.150 --> 00:05:27.860
You'll still be asleep, so I'll wake you,
then we'll eat breakfast like always.

00:05:28.820 --> 00:05:32.410
Ookawa will over sleep,
and Father will get mad at him.

00:05:34.200 --> 00:05:37.210
You'll watch me as I go off to school,

00:05:38.000 --> 00:05:41.960
and when I come back,
you and Father will be working.

00:05:42.670 --> 00:05:44.630
I'll make rice balls for everyone,

00:05:44.710 --> 00:05:47.510
and watch as you work hard
to forge swords.

00:05:48.220 --> 00:05:51.300
I'll have dinner ready
by the time the fire dies down,

00:05:51.390 --> 00:05:54.390
and of course,
I'll make something you like.

00:05:55.850 --> 00:05:58.650
You like meat, so maybe fried chicken?

00:05:59.150 --> 00:06:02.020
Once dinner's done,
we'll watch the sun set

00:06:02.110 --> 00:06:04.400
and talk about things
that happened that day.

00:06:05.110 --> 00:06:07.610
The happy things, the sad things...

00:06:08.240 --> 00:06:10.660
The fun things,
the boring things, all of them.

00:06:11.370 --> 00:06:15.040
All the things that happened to us
while we were apart.

00:06:15.830 --> 00:06:19.170
I believe we can go back
to that life together.

00:06:20.130 --> 00:06:21.420
I believe!

00:06:23.170 --> 00:06:24.050
So...

00:06:27.130 --> 00:06:28.380
Thank you, Sayaka.

00:06:29.680 --> 00:06:31.550
I hope you always remember me.

00:06:31.640 --> 00:06:34.180
Why are you saying that? Don't, Gai!

00:06:34.930 --> 00:06:39.140
It's the only way for me
to know I truly existed at all.

00:06:39.560 --> 00:06:42.730
What? Stop it, Gai!
You make it sound like this is the end!

00:06:46.570 --> 00:06:48.530
He's... coming!

00:06:51.280 --> 00:06:52.120
Matoba!

00:06:53.450 --> 00:06:55.540
Come here, girl.

00:06:57.540 --> 00:06:58.750
Move!

00:07:04.880 --> 00:07:05.710
Gai!

00:07:13.050 --> 00:07:14.510
Stop it...

00:07:22.310 --> 00:07:23.150
Gai!

00:07:26.730 --> 00:07:27.610
Gai!

00:07:31.910 --> 00:07:32.740
Gai!

00:07:36.080 --> 00:07:38.120
Where's Sayaka?

00:07:39.120 --> 00:07:41.290
She was taken by that Busoma.

00:07:44.670 --> 00:07:45.500
Gai!

00:07:51.880 --> 00:07:52.800
You mustn't!

00:07:53.090 --> 00:07:53.970
Let me go!

00:07:54.220 --> 00:07:57.140
You mustn't!
If you go out there now you'll die!

00:07:57.600 --> 00:08:00.770
Let me go! I will save Sayaka!

00:08:00.850 --> 00:08:02.980
Don't you care if you die?

00:08:03.060 --> 00:08:04.690
Don't go, Gai!

00:08:06.690 --> 00:08:07.520
Please!

00:08:11.320 --> 00:08:13.320
I want to protect Sayaka!

00:08:34.090 --> 00:08:35.180
Himiko...

00:08:35.260 --> 00:08:37.350
Gai, go.

00:08:37.430 --> 00:08:38.470
Thank you.

00:08:38.560 --> 00:08:42.980
When this is all over,
let me sleep within you as a weapon.

00:08:56.200 --> 00:08:57.030
Why?

00:09:00.910 --> 00:09:01.750
Lady Himiko!

00:09:02.290 --> 00:09:03.290
Stay away!

00:09:04.000 --> 00:09:06.500
Kazumo, don't look at me!

00:09:11.380 --> 00:09:13.210
Yes, that's right...

00:09:20.260 --> 00:09:22.220
I knew it...

00:09:22.720 --> 00:09:23.560
I'm...

00:09:26.390 --> 00:09:27.230
Gai...

00:09:27.850 --> 00:09:29.360
I... I actually...

00:09:30.070 --> 00:09:32.280
I'm in...

00:09:39.820 --> 00:09:40.990
Lady Himiko.

00:09:48.420 --> 00:09:50.340
Kazumo, let me go.

00:09:51.170 --> 00:09:52.630
You'll die too!

00:09:52.710 --> 00:09:55.220
I refuse. I won't leave you alone.

00:09:57.760 --> 00:09:58.590
Fool.

00:10:27.540 --> 00:10:29.210
<i>What is this aching?</i>

00:10:30.250 --> 00:10:33.420
<i>Are these... his feelings?</i>

00:10:37.130 --> 00:10:38.220
Matoba?

00:10:38.840 --> 00:10:40.050
I am the Shiryu.

00:10:41.140 --> 00:10:42.100
Shiryu?

00:10:43.890 --> 00:10:45.470
Give me back Matoba!

00:10:46.180 --> 00:10:49.600
He's not like you at all! He's kind!

00:10:49.690 --> 00:10:53.310
Get out of him! Get out of his body!

00:10:56.150 --> 00:10:56.990
Silence.

00:11:01.030 --> 00:11:02.570
Give Matoba back.

00:11:06.330 --> 00:11:07.580
What is this?

00:11:08.790 --> 00:11:09.620
Matoba?

00:11:12.330 --> 00:11:13.170
Gai!

00:11:40.780 --> 00:11:42.160
Where is Sayaka?

00:11:43.530 --> 00:11:46.200
Light and shadow. Let us end this.

00:11:47.240 --> 00:11:48.580
Light and shadow.

00:11:49.250 --> 00:11:51.750
Forces that cannot exist
without the other.

00:11:52.670 --> 00:11:57.500
But now light and shadow intermingle,
and both become one.

00:11:57.590 --> 00:11:59.840
The superior or inferior version.

00:12:00.880 --> 00:12:03.300
The Busoshin's birth draws near.

00:12:35.880 --> 00:12:38.210
-I-Is it good?
-Yeah!

00:12:45.130 --> 00:12:46.050
What is this?

00:12:46.970 --> 00:12:47.800
Look!

00:12:48.600 --> 00:12:50.930
The sun... disappeared?

00:12:53.270 --> 00:12:55.400
No... Brother!

00:12:56.310 --> 00:12:58.770
That's right!
I have to protect Brother!

00:13:00.530 --> 00:13:02.650
H-Hey, wait!

00:13:15.250 --> 00:13:16.370
Why?

00:13:16.710 --> 00:13:18.790
Why do you remain in human form?

00:13:19.170 --> 00:13:21.750
If you two do not become weapons
and cross swords,

00:13:22.050 --> 00:13:23.760
the Busoshin will not be born!

00:13:26.050 --> 00:13:26.880
Gai!

00:13:28.300 --> 00:13:29.640
Both of you, stop!

00:13:29.800 --> 00:13:30.640
Sayaka!

00:13:31.180 --> 00:13:33.270
There's no reason for you to fight!

00:13:33.850 --> 00:13:35.810
Wake up, Matoba!

00:13:42.360 --> 00:13:44.150
You don't care about me.

00:13:45.280 --> 00:13:50.030
Why does... everyone leave me?

00:13:51.830 --> 00:13:52.660
This boy...

00:13:53.330 --> 00:13:56.040
Is it possible he still has
a human heart?

00:14:00.130 --> 00:14:02.420
S-Stop!

00:14:06.470 --> 00:14:08.550
I won't give you Sayaka Ogata!

00:14:15.430 --> 00:14:19.350
You hold on to your hearts
because of this worthless thing?

00:14:19.440 --> 00:14:20.310
Ridiculous.

00:14:20.860 --> 00:14:21.810
Ridiculous!

00:14:23.070 --> 00:14:24.940
Abandon your human heart.

00:14:25.990 --> 00:14:29.700
Unless you become one as Busoma,
the Busoshin will not be born.

00:14:30.200 --> 00:14:32.200
Behold!

00:14:43.800 --> 00:14:45.340
Sayaka!

00:14:46.420 --> 00:14:48.760
Become a Busoma!
Abandon your humanity!

00:14:49.010 --> 00:14:50.890
Out of the way!

00:14:58.560 --> 00:15:01.150
Very good. I shall make a prophecy.

00:15:01.230 --> 00:15:05.320
If you can defeat me, the time will come.

00:15:05.400 --> 00:15:07.280
The Busoshin will be born.

00:15:18.700 --> 00:15:21.210
Weak! Too weak!

00:15:21.290 --> 00:15:24.090
I am the symbol of madness and murder!

00:15:24.170 --> 00:15:26.750
You cannot defeat me
unless you abandon your heart.

00:15:28.010 --> 00:15:28.840
Brother!

00:15:31.130 --> 00:15:31.970
Rie.

00:15:40.600 --> 00:15:42.350
Gai!

00:15:42.810 --> 00:15:43.690
Are you okay?

00:15:44.940 --> 00:15:45.770
Kuromaru...

00:16:00.660 --> 00:16:03.040
Out of my way, maggots!

00:16:11.010 --> 00:16:14.550
I shall cut the chains
that bind you to humanity!

00:16:16.010 --> 00:16:18.680
Stop!

00:16:33.150 --> 00:16:35.910
Excellent, I have won.

00:16:35.990 --> 00:16:37.950
The Busoshin will be born.

00:16:38.200 --> 00:16:42.210
Now fight, and become one!

00:16:56.720 --> 00:17:00.140
Being of shadow, disappear within me!

00:17:00.640 --> 00:17:04.560
The shadow will not disappear.
It shall fall upon you!

00:17:23.370 --> 00:17:25.000
Wh-What is that?

00:17:25.670 --> 00:17:27.120
Forget it.

00:17:27.500 --> 00:17:31.960
Issei, why don't we give it another go?

00:17:55.400 --> 00:17:58.990
No matter which of them wins,
the two Shiryu will become one.

00:17:59.570 --> 00:18:01.080
And the Busoshin will be born.

00:18:02.330 --> 00:18:05.040
The Busoshin will lead humanity
to its destruction.

00:18:05.830 --> 00:18:10.130
But if there is any humanity
within the victor...

00:18:11.880 --> 00:18:15.550
The power to overcome a weapon,
feelings to control its spirit...

00:18:16.340 --> 00:18:18.430
What would happen then?

00:18:22.680 --> 00:18:23.510
Gai.

00:18:39.700 --> 00:18:40.530
<i>Gai!</i>

00:18:42.160 --> 00:18:43.580
<i>Let's go home.</i>

00:18:44.870 --> 00:18:47.540
<i>Let's go home... together.</i>

00:18:49.620 --> 00:18:51.540
<i>Yes, let's go home.</i>

00:18:52.840 --> 00:18:53.670
<i>Together.</i>

00:19:02.010 --> 00:19:04.810
Gai, it looks like it can't be me.

00:19:06.600 --> 00:19:10.140
The only one who can stop the birth
of the Busoshin is you.

00:19:12.020 --> 00:19:12.860
Matoba...

00:19:16.780 --> 00:19:21.160
Take care of Ogata, okay?

00:19:40.010 --> 00:19:41.010
Matoba...

00:19:49.520 --> 00:19:50.350
Brother...

00:20:00.280 --> 00:20:01.490
Hey, will you...

00:20:02.910 --> 00:20:04.450
Will you be my friend?

00:20:07.410 --> 00:20:08.240
Yeah.
